# Contact form delivery. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in.
#
# The one variable here is optional. Without it the form fails gracefully and
# points visitors at the direct email address instead.
#
# Validated at startup by lib/env.ts — a malformed key fails immediately rather
# than at send time in production. An empty value (as shipped below) is read as
# "not configured", not as "".

# Web3Forms access key, from https://web3forms.com — a UUID, emailed to you.
# Enquiries are delivered to the address the key was issued to, so there is no
# sender domain to own and no DNS to verify.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
